// HackTool - Hashcat Password Cracker Execution | T1110.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_hashcat.yml
process.executable.caseless:*\\hashcat.exe OR (process.command_line:*\-a\ * AND process.command_line:*\-m\ 1000\ * AND process.command_line:*\-r\ *)
